<%= content_for :page_title, "You cannot remove the last Register user" %>

<h1 class="govuk-heading-l">You cannot remove the last Register user</h1>

<p class="govuk-body">
  There must always be at least one active user with the Register role.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  Give another user the Register role first, then try again.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  If you have any questions, email <%= support_email %>.
</p>
